cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Whippet in research or teaching, cite this repository."
title: "Whippet: a sub-millisecond matching engine with millisecond-durable streaming on Apache Iggy"
abstract: >-
  Whippet is an independent Apache-2.0 showcase that demonstrates Apache Iggy
  as the durable log, replay source, and fan-out backbone of an electronic
  exchange. It includes a deterministic symbol-sharded matcher, a durable
  gateway, market-data snapshots and deltas, a seeded simulator, an open-loop
  benchmark harness, and a live dashboard.
authors:
  - name: "The Whippet Authors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cryptus-neoxys/whippet"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
keywords:
  - matching engine
  - electronic exchange
  - Apache Iggy
  - message streaming
  - low latency
  - deterministic simulation
